  "limits": [
    "Three complete32x32Original pictures and all12final native outputs physically reviewed. The author normalized boards clip one bottom row of native4 and overlay the lower4rows of native1 with the native4label; those frozen boards remain unchanged. Complete lossless PPM-to-PNG copies and integerNN4views close the physical coverage gap.",
    "119functional Original cells (0/57/62for10516/10517/10510),3570native-owner samples, are retained source detail with no generated HD credit.",
